WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:03.720
Estás tenso.

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.480
So are you.

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:08.480
I just can't stop thinking

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:10.120
about what you said yesterday.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:13.480
That you've never been with anyone.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:15.000
Is it true?

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.280
Yes.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.440
And...

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:24.360
Have you been with someone else

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:25.840
this past year

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:28.640
we’ve been married?

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:30.520
I, um...

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:31.920
Mason!

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:34.440
I just knew I’d see you here.

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:35.600
Isn't it fate?
